| CONFIG key | default | role |
|---|---|---|
| `scenes` | 5 entries {id, mapFront, mapProfile (couch only), turnStartMs, readableMs, scalePeak} | scene set, order, pixel maps (code-authored row-string arrays), per-event timing |
